      "subtitle": "Countdowns & days since",
      "promotionalText": "The days ahead. The moments behind. Count down and count up with photos, illustrated backgrounds, flexible reminders, widgets, and countdowns you can share.",
      "description": "Make room for the days that matter.\n\nSoon and Since counts down to the days you\u2019re looking forward to and counts up from the moments you want to remember. Birthdays, trips, weddings, anniversaries, a new habit, a fresh start: give each one a place of its own.\n\nLOOK FORWARD WITH SOON\nSee what\u2019s coming next and watch the countdown change. Count in days, weeks, sleeps, or hours, and set yearly repeats for dates that come around again.\n\nLOOK BACK WITH SINCE\nKeep track of how long it\u2019s been since something began. Celebrate your progress, remember your favorite moments, and set reminders for milestones.\n\nMAKE EVERY EVENT YOURS\nChoose a photo or explore colors, gradients, patterns, textures, and illustrated backgrounds. Add an icon and pick a font to make each event feel like you.\n\nREMEMBER THE DATE\nSet reminders for the day itself or ahead of time. Keep important dates close with Home Screen and Lock Screen widgets.\n\nSHARE A LITTLE ANTICIPATION\nCreate a story or square countdown image, copy a countdown as text, or share an event as a calendar file.\n\nGIVE YOUR DAYS A BIGGER PICTURE\nOn iPad, browse events beside a live countdown or turn your tablet into a countdown board with wall mode.\n\nNo account needed. Your events are saved on your device.\n\nFor the days ahead. And the days behind.",
      "whatsNew": "Countdowns is now Soon and Since.\n\n\u2022 A completely redesigned app with warm paper, bold numbers, and a touch of highlighter.\n\u2022 Soon counts down to the days ahead. Since counts up from the moments behind.\n\u2022 Personalize events with photos, colors, gradients, patterns, textures, illustrations, icons, and fonts.\n\u2022 Choose days, weeks, sleeps, or hours.\n\u2022 Set reminders and yearly repeats, and celebrate milestones.\n\u2022 Keep events close with Home Screen and Lock Screen widgets.\n\u2022 Enjoy a roomy iPad layout and countdown wall mode.\n\u2022 Share countdown images, copy countdown text, or send a calendar file.\n\u2022 Choose from a refreshed collection of app icons.",
      "keywords": "countdown,countup,timer,birthday,anniversary,vacation,wedding,holiday,reminder,widget,milestone",
      "copyright": "2026 Chris Stayte"
    },
